                "text": "The inaction on our southern border by this admin is TREASON.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nOur border is the number 1 issue in America: it is a human rights, national security, & health crisis we must address. Just earlier this week, an AZ rancher spotted MS-13 members in his yard! There\u2019s cartels, gang members, and terrorists crossing our border during this invasion.\n\nI've co-sponsored articles of impeachment against Mayorkas & Biden for their dereliction of duty regarding border security. \n\nThe House has already passed HR2, and the Senate needs to their job. But we also MUST ENFORCE our existing laws.",
