                "retweet_count": 115,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This week, I co-sponsored and voted for H.R. 1425, the No WHO Pandemic Preparedness Treaty Without Senate Approval Act, in response to the Biden-Harris administration\u2019s secretive negotiations with the World Health Organization (WHO.) Their so-called pandemic preparedness treaty threatens American sovereignty. The Constitution matters and should not be bypassed by treating this as an executive agreement to avoid Senate approval.\n\nThis crucial legislation, introduced by @RepTiffany, would require any pandemic-related convention of the WHO that seeks to bind the United States to be ratified by the Senate as a treaty. We must protect the rights of Americans.",
