                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Rescissions Act of 2025 is a game-changer! We'd cut trillions in wasteful spending, including significant reductions to our UN contributions. It's time for other member states to pay their fair share! This bill rescinds funds for the World Health Organization and UNRWA, aligning with President @realDonaldTrump's executive orders. We're ensuring U.S. resources are used effectively and in line with American interests.",
