                "retweet_count": 24,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I'm proud to announce my support for the Military Construction, Veterans Affairs, and Related Agencies Appropriations Act, 2026, which provides a total of $453 billion in funding to support our veterans and strengthen our national security. This bill fully funds veterans' health care, benefits, and VA programs, while investing $18 billion in military construction and family housing. We're also prioritizing the Indo-Pacific region, supporting the Guard and Reserve, and protecting our 2nd Amendment rights. Let's continue to honor our veterans and keep America safe and strong! \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
