                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Every day Hakeem Jeffries & Chuck Schumer refuse to pass the House\u2019s clean funding bill, vital services for veterans & their families are at risk.\n\n17,800 VA workers face furloughs\nSuicide prevention & mental health programs rely on this funding.\n\nHomelessness & nursing home care could be disrupted.\n\nSenate Dems must stop playing politics & pass the bill NOW. Our vets deserve better.",
