                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019m deeply saddened to learn that three young lives were lost to suicide this week in Seminole County. My heart goes out to their families, friends, and the students and staff across SCPS who are grieving this unimaginable loss.\n\nMental health is not a political issue, it\u2019s personal. As your representative, I remain committed to supporting local schools, families, and organizations working to reach our kids before tragedy strikes.\n\nIf you or someone you know is struggling, please reach out for help:\n- 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline \u2013 call or text 24/7\n- Youth Outlook Clinic (MHA Central FL) \u2013 peer-led support for ages 6\u201317\n-  NAMI Central Florida \u2013 resources for families and loved ones\n\nYou are not alone. Together, we can bring hope and healing to the young people of Seminole County.",
