                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "America\u2019s warfighters deserve the best.\n\nI support the FY26 NDAA commitment to deliver major investments to strengthen readiness and keep our servicemembers safe:\n\n\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 $10M for Next-Gen Body Armor\n\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 $9.5M for Secure Communications\n\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 $2.5M for Tactical Medicine Simulation for Training\n\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 Improved sports nutrition, base welfare, and post-military job certifications\n\nI support legislation that ensures our troops have the tools, training, and technology needed to defend our country.",
