                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I voted YES on H.R. 6703, the Lower Health Care Premiums for All Americans Act, because Florida families deserve affordable, accessible health insurance without Washington driving up costs.\n\nThis commonsense legislation takes real steps to lower premiums, expand access to quality coverage, and put patients, not bureaucrats, in charge of their health care decisions.\n\nDelivering relief, expanding choice, and putting Florida families first.",
